# Zood design identity (Pay at Table)

Source of truth for humans: `docs/ZOOD_DESIGN_SYSTEM.md`  
Visual reference: Teams / Dot-Ai (`AppColors.primary`). Same brand as Self Order.

## Brand

- Primary / CTA: `#004FEE`
- Primary dark: `#0039C7` · bright: `#4C7AF5` · disabled: `#82A9F8`
- Soft primary: `#E7EDFB`
- Font: `Cairo` only (`AppTheme.fontFamily`)
- Light mode only

## Semantic & surfaces

- Success: `#0F9F8A` (border accent `#1BDAC0`)
- Error: `#C01148`
- Ink: `#1C2434` · muted `#4D5F73` · subtle `#9B9B9B`
- Background: `#F5F7FA` · surface `#FFFFFF` · surfaceMuted `#EEF2FA` · border `#F2F2F2`
- Page gradient: `#EEF2FA` → `#F5F7FD` → `#EDF0F8`
- CTA / hero gradients: blue family only (`#0039C7` / `#004FEE` / `#4C7AF5`)

## Do not

- Keep legacy PAT blue `#1B3FDB` or orange accent `#E8892C` as brand
- Keep cream shell `#F4F1EB` / `#FFFCF8` as brand surfaces
- Swap Cairo for Inter / Noto Kufi / system fonts on customer screens
- Use sub-brand accents unless explicitly requested:
  - IM pink `#FA6A99`
  - Teams wordmark purple `#7048C0`
  - Dot-Ai kiosk sky `#78CBEF` / pink button `#FF608F`
- Invent purple / red / orange brand gradients (`warmGradient` must not be orange)

## UI patterns

- Primary button: fill `#004FEE` or `ctaGradient`, white label; disabled `#82A9F8`
- Secondary: soft primary or surface muted, label `#004FEE`
- Cards: white, light border, soft shadow; elevation 0 preferred
- Inputs: radius from `AppTheme` (10 / 16 / 24), focus with primary
- Weights: `w700` titles, `w400` / `w600` body

## When changing colors

Update `lib/Styles/AppColors.dart` (and web/Android theme_color if present). Do not reintroduce the old cream/orange PAT palette as brand.
